    <bpmn:process id="W_W4897" name="W4897. PA / Paging System Daily Operations &amp; Live Announcement Protocol" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Store open (links VS-07.1); customer page; department/receiving/security call; emergency
Frequency: Daily, ~10–30 announcements/store/day
Volume: 200 stores × ~10–30 live announcements/day → ~60,000–180,000 announcements/month group-wide
Owner: Store Manager / Assistant Store Manager / Customer Service Rep
Participants: Store staff (VS-07), In-Store Media Manager (VS-168), LP (VS-23), HSE (VS-24)
Source: workflow W4897 — PA / Paging System Daily Operations &amp; Live Announcement Protocol</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4897_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4897_Lane1" name="Various Staff">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4897_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4897_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4897_Lane2" name="Assistant SM">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4897_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4897_Lane3" name="Store Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4897_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4897_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4897_Start5" name="Store open (links VS-07.1); customer page; department/receiving/security call; emergency">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4897_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4897_Task6" name="Execute the standard announcement protocol per VS-07.1 (opening, customer…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Execute the standard announcement protocol per VS-07.1 (opening, customer service, department calls, receiving, coded security alerts, closing): use the standard opening, no slang/jokes/personal messages, no full customer names for privacy (use order-number reference) unless consented, and the coded-LP protocol (links VS-23)
Responsible (R): Various Staff / Customer Service Rep / Assistant SM
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 30 sec–1 min each</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4897_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4897_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4897_Task7" name="Manage the PA system: confirm microphone health, override background music…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Manage the PA system: confirm microphone health, override background music during announcements (auto-ducking), respect volume/quiet-hour limits, and log security/coded announcements for LP review (VS-23)
Responsible (R): Assistant SM / LP
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4897_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4897_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4897_Task8" name="Handle exceptions &amp; privacy: manage consent for customer-name paging (RA…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Handle exceptions &amp; privacy: manage consent for customer-name paging (RA 10173), avoid paging sensitive info, escalate any misuse, and feed PA-usage/quality issues to the In-Store Media Manager (VS-168)
Responsible (R): Store Manager / In-Store Media Manager
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4897_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4897_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4897_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4897_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-735 (ensure controlled execution — In-Store Audio, PA &amp; Media Daily Operations (PA-168.2).) | - CTL-735: standard announcement protocol; privacy/order-number rule; coded-LP logged; volume/quiet-hour limits
Owner: Store Manager / Assistant Store Manager / Customer Service Rep</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4897_Assoc11" sourceRef="W4897_Annotation10" targetRef="W4897_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
