    <bpmn:process id="W_W4899" name="W4899. In-Store Digital Signage Content Scheduling, Publishing &amp; Playback Operations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Campaign refresh (VS-14/VS-58); daypart change; content update (W4893)
Frequency: Continuous scheduling + per-campaign publish
Volume: ~6–10 screens per store × 200 stores × campaign cycle; monthly promo refresh
Owner: In-Store Media &amp; Brand-Experience Manager / Marketing Content
Participants: Marketing (VS-14), Retail Media (VS-48), Store Ops (VS-07), IT/AV (VS-27/VS-138), DAM (VS-137)
Source: workflow W4899 — In-Store Digital Signage Content Scheduling, Publishing &amp; Playback Operations</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4899_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4899_Lane1" name="Marketing Content">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4899_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4899_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4899_Lane2" name="IT">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4899_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4899_Lane3" name="In-Store Media Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4899_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4899_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4899_Start5" name="Campaign refresh (VS-14/VS-58); daypart change; content update (W4893)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4899_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4899_Task6" name="Schedule the signage playlist per screen/zone/daypart (W4893): BuildRight brand…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Schedule the signage playlist per screen/zone/daypart (W4893): BuildRight brand content + VS-48 vendor-ad slots + promo overlays (VS-58/VS-64) + mandatory compliance content (PWD/senior discount VS-85, price-integrity RA 7394, safety/wayfinding W4398); set the publish window
Responsible (R): Marketing Content / In-Store Media Manager / Retail Media
Accountable (A): In-Store Media Manager
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4899_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4899_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4899_Task7" name="Publish &amp; verify playback: push content via the CMS to 200 stores, confirm…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Publish &amp; verify playback: push content via the CMS to 200 stores, confirm receipt/playback, auto-flag offline/stale screens (W4900), and manage store-specific/localized variants (W4903)
Responsible (R): IT / Marketing Content / DAM
Accountable (A): In-Store Media Manager
Duration: Per publish</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4899_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4899_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4899_Task8" name="Audit playback compliance (W4908): confirm mandatory content is showing, promo…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Audit playback compliance (W4908): confirm mandatory content is showing, promo prices match the POS/shelf (links VS-151 price-integrity), VS-48 vendor-ad slots match contracts, and feed exceptions to resolution
Responsible (R): In-Store Media Manager / Retail Media / Store Ops
Accountable (A): In-Store Media Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4899_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4899_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4899_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4899_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-735 (ensure controlled execution — In-Store Audio, PA &amp; Media Daily Operations (PA-168.2).) | - CTL-735: mandatory compliance content enforced; promo price matches POS/shelf; VS-48 slots per contract; playback-audited
Owner: In-Store Media &amp; Brand-Experience Manager / Marketing Content</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
