      <bpmn:userTask id="W4900_Task5" name="Monitor AV-equipment health: central dashboard of…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Monitor AV-equipment health: central dashboard of player/screens/speakers/amps/mics across 205 sites, auto-flag offline/faulty units, and triage to IT (VS-27) vs facilities (VS-138) vs vendor (W4910); integrate to the CAFM/BMS (VS-138)
Responsible (R): IT / Facilities AV Lead / In-Store Media Manager
Accountable (A): Facilities AV Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4900_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4900_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4900_Task6" name="Run preventive maintenance: scheduled inspection/cleaning of…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Run preventive maintenance: scheduled inspection/cleaning of speakers/screens/players/mics, firmware updates (VS-27/VS-99), bulb/battery/backlight replacement for signage, and cable/connector checks; manage via work-orders (VS-138)
Responsible (R): Facilities / IT / Vendor
Accountable (A): Facilities AV Lead
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4900_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4900_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
