      <bpmn:userTask id="W4900_Task7" name="Handle reactive faults &amp; lifecycle: dispatch repair/replace, minimize…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Handle reactive faults &amp; lifecycle: dispatch repair/replace, minimize trading-hours downtime, record assets (VS-35), and feed end-of-life/refresh needs to capex (W4906); verify post-repair playback (W4908)
Responsible (R): Facilities / IT / Asset Mgmt
Accountable (A): In-Store Media Manager
Duration: Reactive</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4900_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
