    <bpmn:process id="W_W4902" name="W4902. Emergency Override &amp; Public-Address Incident Protocol" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Fire/alarm (VS-24); evacuation; security incident (VS-23/VS-147); typhoon/disaster (VS-69); AMBER/missing-child
Frequency: Rare (drill + incident)
Volume: ~205 sites × drills + rare real incidents
Owner: Store Manager / HSE (VS-24) / LP (VS-23) / Crisis Mgmt (VS-14.3)
Participants: HSE (VS-24), LP (VS-23), Facilities (VS-138), In-Store Media Manager (VS-168), Customer Safety (VS-147)
Source: workflow W4902 — Emergency Override &amp; Public-Address Incident Protocol</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4902_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4902_Lane1" name="Store Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4902_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4902_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4902_Lane2" name="HSE">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4902_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4902_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4902_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4902_Start4" name="Fire/alarm (VS-24); evacuation; security incident (VS-23/VS-147); typhoon/disaster…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4902_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4902_Task5" name="Override all in-store media on emergency trigger: cut background music…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Override all in-store media on emergency trigger: cut background music, interrupt signage with emergency messaging, and broadcast the pre-recorded or live emergency announcement (evacuation, shelter-in-place, lockdown) per the incident type; the PA must override every other audio source
Responsible (R): Store Manager / HSE / LP
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Immediate</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4902_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4902_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4902_Task6" name="Execute the incident protocol per VS-24/VS-147/VS-69: coordinate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Execute the incident protocol per VS-24/VS-147/VS-69: coordinate evacuation/shelter, manage customer safety (VS-147), engage LP/security (VS-23) and crisis comms (VS-14.3), and maintain the emergency PA until all-clear
Responsible (R): HSE / LP / Store Manager / Crisis Mgmt
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Per incident</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4902_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4902_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4902_Task7" name="Test, document &amp; improve: run periodic emergency-override drills (links VS-24…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Test, document &amp; improve: run periodic emergency-override drills (links VS-24 tabletop/W1204), verify the override works on every site, log incidents/drills, and feed findings to the In-Store Media Manager and HSE for protocol improvement
Responsible (R): HSE / In-Store Media Manager / Facilities
Accountable (A): HSE Lead
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4902_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4902_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4902_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4902_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-735 (ensure controlled execution — In-Store Audio, PA &amp; Media Daily Operations (PA-168.2).) | - CTL-735: emergency override tested every site per drill cycle; pre-recorded standard messages; BCP-drill-verified (VS-24)
Owner: Store Manager / HSE (VS-24) / LP (VS-23) / Crisis Mgmt (VS-14.3)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
