    <bpmn:process id="W_W4903" name="W4903. In-Store Media Content Localization &amp; Filipino / Regional-Language Voice" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Multi-region footprint (Mindanao/Visayas/Luzon/NCR); localization refresh (VS-14/W4150)
Frequency: Continuous + per refresh
Volume: ~4–6 regional-language variants (Filipino/English + Cebuano/Ilonggo/Bicolano/Waray) × campaign refresh
Owner: In-Store Media &amp; Brand-Experience Manager / Brand / Marketing Content
Participants: Marketing (VS-14), Store Ops Regional (VS-07), DAM (VS-137), Localization (W4150)
Source: workflow W4903 — In-Store Media Content Localization &amp; Filipino / Regional-Language Voice</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4903_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4903_Lane1" name="Brand">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4903_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4903_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
