      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4903_Start5" name="Multi-region footprint (Mindanao/Visayas/Luzon/NCR); localization refresh (VS-14/W4150)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4903_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4903_Task6" name="Define the localization standard: Filipino/English bilingual baseline (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Define the localization standard: Filipino/English bilingual baseline (links W1346/W4150), regional-language voice-over for key signage/PA content where the customer base warrants (Cebuano in Cebu/Mindanao, Ilonggo in Iloilo, Bicolano in Bicol, Waray), and the brand-voice consistency rules across languages
Responsible (R): Brand / Marketing Content / Localization
Accountable (A): In-Store Media Manager
Duration: Per refresh</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4903_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4903_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4903_Task7" name="Produce &amp; publish localized content: record/curate regional voice/music…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Produce &amp; publish localized content: record/curate regional voice/music variants in the DAM (VS-137), schedule region-appropriate playback (W4899), and verify cultural/regional appropriateness (no regional-sensitivity missteps)
Responsible (R): Marketing Content / DAM / Localization
Accountable (A): In-Store Media Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4903_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4903_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4903_Task8" name="Measure localization effectiveness: regional CX/CSAT (VS-13/VS-146)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Measure localization effectiveness: regional CX/CSAT (VS-13/VS-146), comprehension/engagement, and feed learnings to refine the regional-language mix
Responsible (R): Analytics / CX / Regional Store Ops
Accountable (A): In-Store Media Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4903_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4903_End9" name="Complete">
