        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-735 (ensure controlled execution — In-Store Audio, PA &amp; Media Daily Operations (PA-168.2).) | - CTL-735: bilingual baseline + regional variants per standard; regional review; brand-voice consistency verified
Owner: In-Store Media &amp; Brand-Experience Manager / Brand / Marketing Content</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
