    <bpmn:process id="W_W4904" name="W4904. Vendor Music / Signage Content Refresh &amp; Asset Library Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Refresh cycle (W4890/W4893); vendor content delivery; DAM lifecycle (VS-137)
Frequency: Continuous + per refresh
Volume: ~500–800 content assets (music playlists, signage creative, voice, scent formulas) × refresh cycle
Owner: In-Store Media &amp; Brand-Experience Manager / DAM Lead (VS-137) / Marketing Content
Participants: Commercial music provider (W4892), Retail Media (VS-48), DAM (VS-137), Marketing (VS-14), Legal (VS-100.2)
Source: workflow W4904 — Vendor Music / Signage Content Refresh &amp; Asset Library Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4904_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4904_Lane1" name="Marketing Content">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4904_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4904_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4904_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4904_Lane2" name="DAM Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4904_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4904_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4904_Start4" name="Refresh cycle (W4890/W4893); vendor content delivery; DAM lifecycle (VS-137)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4904_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4904_Task5" name="Manage the vendor content refresh: receive/schedule the music-service catalog…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Manage the vendor content refresh: receive/schedule the music-service catalog updates (W4892), VS-48 vendor-ad creative, retail-media and brand content, and scent formulas (W4894); verify rights/license coverage (W4891) before ingest
Responsible (R): Marketing Content / In-Store Media Manager / Legal
Accountable (A): In-Store Media Manager
Duration: Per refresh</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4904_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4904_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4904_Task6" name="Govern the asset library in the DAM (VS-137): versioning, metadata/tagging…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Govern the asset library in the DAM (VS-137): versioning, metadata/tagging, rights/expiry tracking (links VS-100.2 IP), localization variants (W4903), and the publish-to-archive lifecycle; prevent stale/expired assets from playing
Responsible (R): DAM Lead / Marketing Content / Legal
Accountable (A): In-Store Media Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4904_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4904_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4904_Task7" name="Coordinate the refresh cadence: align music/signage/scent refresh to the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Coordinate the refresh cadence: align music/signage/scent refresh to the merchandising/marketing calendar (W4901), retire expired content (avoid stale-promo RA 7394 risk), and report asset-library health/coverage
Responsible (R): Marketing Content / DAM / Analytics
Accountable (A): In-Store Media Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4904_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4904_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4904_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4904_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-735 (ensure controlled execution — In-Store Audio, PA &amp; Media Daily Operations (PA-168.2).) | - CTL-735: rights/expiry tracked in DAM; content retired before expiry; versioned/metadata-tagged; refresh aligned to calendar
Owner: In-Store Media &amp; Brand-Experience Manager / DAM Lead (VS-137) / Marketing Content</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
